  "notes": "Low-entry midibus; SAD Poprad vehicles 2017-2018, withdrawn 2023. FPT NEF4 Euro 6 diesel 137 kW, Allison 2100 automatic. Height 3,007 mm with air conditioning. Floor 325 mm (door 1), 330 mm (door 2). Wheelbase 4,580 mm. Capacity excludes the driver. The battery-electric e-ATAK (8,315 mm, 220 kWh, up to 300 km, max. 52 passengers per Karsan) has no published top speed and is not covered by this entry."
